/P 233 0 R
/E (Industry 4.0 represents the fourth industrial revolution, where advanced technologies such as the Internet of Things \(IoT\), Artificial Intelligence \(AI\), robotics, cloud computing, and big data are integrated into industrial processes. It enables smart, connected systems that communicate and operate in real time, leading to improved efficiency, productivity, and flexibility in manufacturing and automation.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
