314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 233 0 R
/E (Smart Manufacturing is the use of advanced digital technologies to monitor, control, and optimize production processes. It relies on real-time data, automation, and intelligent decision-making to improve product quality, reduce downtime, increase operational efficiency, and enable customized production based on market demands.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
