316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 233 0 R
/E (Digital Twin Technology is the creation of a virtual replica of a physical system, process, or product. The digital twin continuously receives data from the physical system and replicates its behavior in a virtual environment. This technology enables real-time monitoring, performance analysis, predictive maintenance, simulation, and better decision-making throughout the system's lifecycle.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
