/P 239 0 R
/E (The robotic arm components were fabricated using the Ender 3 V2 3D printer, a widely used FDM \(Fused Deposition Modeling\) printer known for its reliability and printing accuracy. The printer was utilized to manufacture the arm links, joints, and supporting structures from STL models.)
/Pg 19 0 R
