<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 239 0 R
/E (PLA \(Polylactic Acid\) filament was used for manufacturing the robotic arm components through 3D printing. PLA was selected due to its ease of printing, good dimensional accuracy, lightweight nature, and cost-effectiveness.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 239 0 R
/E (The material provides sufficient strength for the robotic arm's structural components while maintaining a low overall weight, which helps reduce the load on the SG90 servo motors. Additionally, PLA offers good surface finish and is suitable for rapid prototyping and educational robotics applications.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
