420 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1593 0 R
/E (The Arduino UNO serves as the main control unit of the robotic arm, responsible for processing control commands and generating PWM signals to drive the SG90 servo motors. It coordinates the movement of the arm joints by controlling the position of each servo according to the desired motion.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
