450 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 244 0 R
/T (Python plays a crucial role in the development of the intelligent robotic arm system by enabling data generation, processing, and machine learning implementation. It provides a simple and powerful programming environment for performing mathematical calculations and developing predictive models. In this project, Python was used to generate the robotic arm dataset using kinematic equations, preprocess the data, and train a machine learning model for joint angle prediction. The trained model helps estimate the required joint angles for a desired end-effector position, improving the intelligence and automation capabilities of the robotic arm. )
/E (Python plays a crucial role in the development of the intelligent robotic arm system by enabling data generation, processing, and machine learning implementation. It provides a simple and powerful programming environment for performing mathematical calculations and developing predictive models. In this project, Python was used to generate the robotic arm dataset using kinematic equations, preprocess the data, and train a machine learning model for joint angle prediction. The trained model helps estimate the required joint angles for a desired end-effector position, improving the intelligence and automation capabilities of the robotic arm. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
