452 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 244 0 R
/T (TensorFlow is an open-source machine learning framework used for developing and training artificial intelligence models. It provides powerful tools for data processing, neural network development, model training, and prediction. In this project, TensorFlow was used to train a machine learning model using the robotic arm dataset generated from kinematic calculations. The model learns the relationship between the end-effector coordinates and the corresponding joint angles. After training, the model can predict the required joint angles for a desired position, thereby assisting in the intelligent control of the robotic arm and enhancing the functionality of the Digital Twin system.)
/E (TensorFlow is an open-source machine learning framework used for developing and training artificial intelligence models. It provides powerful tools for data processing, neural network development, model training, and prediction. In this project, TensorFlow was used to train a machine learning model using the robotic arm dataset generated from kinematic calculations. The model learns the relationship between the end-effector coordinates and the corresponding joint angles. After training, the model can predict the required joint angles for a desired position, thereby assisting in the intelligent control of the robotic arm and enhancing the functionality of the Digital Twin system.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
