/E (The Meta Quest headset was selected as the Virtual Reality device for this project because of its standalone operation, high-resolution display, and compatibility with the Unity game engine. The headset was configured using the Meta Quest application and connected to the development computer through a USB cable and wireless network. Developer Mode was enabled to allow testing and deployment of VR applications directly from Unity. The device firmware was updated to ensure compatibility with the latest Unity XR tools. Proper calibration of the headset and controllers was performed before executing the VR application to obtain accurate tracking and comfortable visualization.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [4]
>>
